er": "5132", "Batsman": "3752", "Commentary": "Good length on off, it is kept out.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T05:01:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63751", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Back of a length this time and Henry calmly blocks it.", "Summary": {"Score": "45/2", "Over": "8", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "57594", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "19", "Balls": "23", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "3752", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "63751", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T05:01:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63751", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Fuller on middle and off, Nicholls follows that six with a front foot defense.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T05:00:25+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,35,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63751", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "SIX! Effortless! Full on the pads, Nicholls flicks it uppishly and elegantly over square leg, it seems to have gone all the way. The umpire is unsure but the fielder signals it as a maximum and the umpire too does the same.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:59:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63751", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Outside off, Nicholls shoulders arms to it.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:58:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63751", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "This time he is able to flick it but straight to the fielder.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:58:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63751", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "On the leg stump to start off with. Henry looks to flick it but misses. The ball hits him on the pads and the players appeal. The umpire turns it down as it looked to be going down the leg side.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:57:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Hardik Pandya is on.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:57:11+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5132", "Batsman": "3752", "Commentary": "BEATEN! Length delivery outside off, Taylor looks to play at it but gets beaten.", "Summary": {"Score": "39/2", "Over": "7", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3752", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "57594", "Runs": "13", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "5132", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:56:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5132", "Batsman": "3752", "Commentary": "Good length delivery on middle and off. Taylor defends it off his front foot.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:56:08+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5132", "Batsman": "3752", "Commentary": "Good ball. Length delivery pitching outside off, the ball jags back in after pitching. Taylor looks to flick but misses. The ball hits the back pad. There is a huge appeal from the Indian players but the umpire turns it down. Kumar is not too keen to review it and walks back. Height was an issue.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:55:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5132", "Batsman": "3752", "Commentary": "Full on middle and leg, Taylor defends it to strat his innings.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:54:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Ross Taylor is the new man in.", "Timestamp": "2019-01-31T04:53:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "D